{"item_id": "youtube:0jbwN43BuFk", "version_id": "f8aa99d8e5c3ce6843d87e205fcc1c6f56402cbd6e0ab84a0948571824176244", "decision": "defer", "reason": "Under Relevance, this is a rucking weight vest in scope, but the transcript is an unboxing that only describes the curved cast-iron plates and their fit, with no field testing or durability observations. Under Credibility and Unsupported claims, the source offers no evidence beyond GoRuck's stated design rationale, so there is too little to rely on yet; reconsider if a use or wear test appears.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "youtube:psUS6_avZNo", "version_id": "4cf60ab6c238f8087ec22b744a0c87469e5bc1cd26a8315e0103c367c4bbe64a", "decision": "defer", "reason": "Under Relevance, these rucking shoes are in scope under footwear, but this unboxing only reads out the spec sheet (pigskin suede, EVA midsole, 13 mm drop) and offers no wear, comfort, or durability testing. Under Credibility and Commercial incentives, the spec restatement and the reviewer's brief reaction carry little evidential weight, and the transcript doesn't disclose sponsorship, so it is deferred pending hands-on evidence.", "piece_ids": []}
